      "summary": "[P1] plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_reconfirmation.ts:154 的 status capture/recheck 未指定 --ignore-submodules=none；batch_preflight.ts:295-298 的入口检查也一样。配置为 ignore=all 的无关 dirty submodule 会漏过 eligibility、confirmation 和 CAS，直到既有 commit guard 才拒绝，此时 plan binding 已被写入，batch 随后被写为 failed，违反 mixed dirty work 的 raw-byte zero-write 要求。最小修复是两处 status 都显式禁用 submodule ignoring，并覆盖确认前及确认期间出现这类 dirty work 的拒绝测试。",
      "anchor": "sha256:f651abeb3fd9b1521b9d6f93b10b70665daec678caf80f28e195b9bb5b3acbcf",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "不变量类：dirty-envelope refusal 必须独立于 Git presentation configuration。在真实 zero-commit batch 中，revised child 已经完成 matching QA/required Review，且 delivery 保持不变；仓库另有一个 scope 外的既有 submodule，其 submodule.<name>.ignore=all，而其内部 tracked file 已修改。两个 git status 调用均继承 ignore configuration；workspace_scope.ts 的身份读取也未覆盖它，因此 capture/assertUnchanged 通过并允许 replaceBatchRunState 写入。当前普通 staged-file/Intent-sidecar dirty controls 不能覆盖被 Git configuration 隐藏的路径。读取 unchanged plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_git.ts:getChangedProjectPaths 的原因是 changed runner 在 replacement 后调用 commitBatchChild；它显式使用 --ignore-submodules=none，在此时才发现 scope 外 submodule 并抛出 dirty_outside_scope，触发后续 failed state/report 写入。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_preflight.ts:projectBatchPreflight",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_reconfirmation.ts:captureBatchReconfirmation"
        ],
        "violated": {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "ref": "BPR-A1"
        }
      },
      "counterevidence": null
    }
